Source Package Information
==========================

This package uses the standard Debian source format "3.0 (quilt)".

Upstream Source
---------------
Repository: https://github.com/pflarue/ardop
Branch: develop (for latest features) or master (for stable releases)

Build Dependencies
------------------
- libasound2-dev: ALSA sound library development files
- libcmocka-dev: Unit testing framework
- pandoc: For generating manpage from markdown
- build-essential: Standard build tools

Build System
------------
Uses upstream Makefile with minor additions:
- Added rule to generate manpage: make ardopcf.1
- Unit tests run during package build via dh_auto_test

Patches
-------
No patches are currently applied to the upstream source.

 -- Tyler <tyler@dinsmoor.us>
